### Inverse-functionality (YAGO4.5-10-flip) experiment ###
# Scripts, configs and logs are tracked; generated data and outputs are not.
# data/ is regenerated by flip_yago.py and checked by verify_flip.py against
# CHECKSUMS.md; rules/ and predictions_ifp/ ship in the Zenodo snapshot.
